{"artifact_kind":"native_tts_inputs","entries":[{"audio_sha256":"be3064b24d262ad867c93992b79deda21411b3d317f4c25bfcbf3328390b379e","duration_seconds":9.216,"marks_sha256":"e48738e51c00c9835023e33a81beb036f6392c8ba22212a40caf1ab739f0f9c9","request":{"backend":"edge","cache_key":"010a4c9a2aa151943de115d49a4ad199","lead_pause":0.0,"pitch":"+0Hz","rate":"+6%","style":"","styledegree":"","text":"三月，印第安维尔斯止步4强，迈阿密第三轮输给科达。来到蒙特卡洛决赛，又被辛纳两盘击败。","voice":"zh-CN-YunjianNeural"},"request_id":"10183995f0921e03aa6d3d9c2767f443d891be89d3322e6e2e17bf8980c0c8d2"},{"audio_sha256":"f4033df25b923d6ebd3b04d976f5b6566aec60e5f1186ab31d3b1a6c34ea17e9","duration_seconds":3.528,"marks_sha256":"4081d30843ede8b1c0aac3fd6b12ad81be67062206914d78d4c41b8e36193e3e","request":{"backend":"edge","cache_key":"396607e1208a464327555537912012a7","lead_pause":0.0,"pitch":"+0Hz","rate":"+6%","style":"","styledegree":"","text":"阿卡年终路，从伤停到巴黎冠军。","voice":"zh-CN-YunjianNeural"},"request_id":"19f7facbbda3677bf356cf86c8a744f26e5b896129d896832822f5e2a5bb7dd1"},{"audio_sha256":"c1a2b4059842c7b17ddd301032b147c720a60a86301e3738e22e5a872542d8bc","duration_seconds":8.928,"marks_sha256":"1b72cea52940a86a73bc0439953c841d5f3b8a4de18eb12e2bd99b1d8443eb70","request":{"backend":"edge","cache_key":"e9d0dcf5d5018905ffcb903bb26b657b","lead_pause":0.0,"pitch":"+0Hz","rate":"+6%","style":"","styledegree":"","text":"截至十一月九日，六千一百分，赛季积分榜第三。辛纳已退赛，高亮的是本届年终的八位正选。","voice":"zh-CN-YunjianNeural"},"request_id":"4a1e2fd609b2bed73163687e62409be69675317475827a68273af8bccece11eb"},{"audio_sha256":"1017590ff024e5ccefd22642f3314b9de9a61b52ede335d510c45a46aed2eb4b","duration_seconds":8.664,"marks_sha256":"cf555d8c1246ce2ba4fdd80919f1aef7e591c2659d1dfd29dcaf218dfec61f64","request":{"backend":"edge","cache_key":"4a2f78b5a85780c42087627e01c66374","lead_pause":0.0,"pitch":"+0Hz","rate":"+6%","style":"","styledegree":"","text":"巴黎，阿尔卡拉斯拿到赛季第五冠。可在几个月前，他还因为右腕受伤，错过了法网和温网。","voice":"zh-CN-YunjianNeural"},"request_id":"7448d9adcc1cead4cf7ba75a1c5ab10a6fc1d8